Colin Boyd wrote:
>
> I've been following some advice I read that Samurai should start the 
> game fighting with two weapons... but when I get polymorphed and unwield 
> my weapons, I can't figure out how to designate the wakizashi as the 
> secondary weapon again, so every time I press 'x' I'm emptyhanded - one 
> Samurai of mine has already died because of this dumbness.  What do I do?

w- to unwield current primary weapon.
x to switch to secondary.
w- to not wield anything.  You start clean.
wb to wield short sword.
x to make it secondary.
wa to wield katana as primary.
#tw to use both.

Swapping back and forth between a pickaxe to dig and a pair of weapons
to kill can become very common deep into the dungeon.  By then you'll
go through the sequence almost as fast as you can type it.

